page('contact','Contact RemapWorks UK','Book a mobile remapping service in Birmingham or the West Midlands. Call 07376 668716 or send your vehicle details through WhatsApp.',intro('GET IN TOUCH','Book Your<br>Mobile Service.','We come to your location by arrangement. Share your postcode and vehicle details to confirm availability and on-site suitability.')+section('SEND AN ENQUIRY','Tell us what you need.','<div class="formlayout"><div><h3>Speak to RemapWorks UK</h3><a class="phone" href="tel:+447376668716">07376 668716 →</a><p><a href="mailto:remapworksuk@gmail.com">remapworksuk@gmail.com</a></p><p>Birmingham, United Kingdom<br>Serving Birmingham & the West Midlands</p><p>Mobile service — we come to your location by arrangement. Send your postcode to confirm availability and suitability.</p></div>'+form()+'</div>'))
page('privacy-policy','Privacy Policy — Review Draft','Draft privacy information for RemapWorks UK enquiries. Business details require confirmation before public launch.',intro('CLIENT REVIEW DRAFT','Privacy Policy','This draft requires business review and confirmation before public launch.')+section('YOUR INFORMATION','Enquiry privacy.','<div class="prose"><h3>Information in your enquiry</h3><p>The form collects the details you enter, including contact, vehicle, location and service information. The form prepares a WhatsApp URL in your browser; it does not submit to a website database. WhatsApp processes messages under its own terms and privacy policy.</p><h3>Purpose and contact</h3><p>Details are intended for responding to your service enquiry. Contact remapworksuk@gmail.com with privacy questions or rights requests.</p><h3>Details requiring confirmation</h3><p>The business must confirm its legal controller identity, postal contact, lawful basis, retention periods, processors, international transfer arrangements and rights procedure. Hosting providers may process technical access logs; provider and retention details must be confirmed.</p><h3>Analytics and cookies</h3><p>No analytics or advertising tracking is enabled in this preview. A consent implementation and updated policy must be reviewed before adding non-essential tracking.</p><p>For UK data-protection concerns, you may contact the Information Commissioner’s Office. This review draft is not final legal advice.</p></div>'))
page('terms','Terms & Conditions — Review Draft','Draft service terms for client review before public launch of RemapWorks UK.',intro('CLIENT REVIEW DRAFT','Terms & Conditions','For client and professional review before public launch. These are not final legal terms.')+section('SERVICE ARRANGEMENTS','Confirm before booking.','<div class="prose"><h3>Enquiries and quotations</h3><p>An enquiry is not a confirmed booking. Starting prices are indicative. Agree the vehicle-specific scope, full price, location and timing directly with RemapWorks UK before proceeding.</p><h3>Suitability and modifications</h3><p>Vehicle compatibility and condition require assessment. Customers should discuss proposed changes with their insurer and check warranty, finance and lease conditions. Fixed power gains or economy improvements are not promised.</p><h3>Lawful work</h3><p>Road vehicles must retain required safety and emissions systems. The website accepts enquiries for compliant diagnostic and repair services.</p><h3>Business confirmation required</h3><p>Legal trading identity and address, payment and deposit terms, cancellation and refund rights, complaint handling, workmanship provisions, liability wording and applicable consumer rights must be confirmed and reviewed before these terms are used with customers.</p></div>'))
